# Internal tooling and builds

# JDBC Drivers & Large Binaries
# Both JARs are committed — no build step required for customers
!connect/jars/mssql-jdbc-*.jar
!connect/jars/kafka-connect-sqlserver-case-restorer-*.jar
# JMX agent jar committed directly — Maven Central unreachable in proxy environments

